# Repository-local intake, build, secrets, and disposable work areas
/00_远端接收区/
/20_交付构建/
/90_本地私密配置_不提交/
/99_垃圾存储区/

# Environment and credentials: examples are safe to commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.mobileprovision

